{"name":"Thermocline","hex":"#8fadbd","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"thermocline","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A layer within a body of water or air where the temperature changes rapidly with depth."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/thermocline"}],"entries":[{"title":"Thermocline","blocks":[{"text":"A thermocline is\na distinct layer based on temperature within a large body of fluid with a high gradient of distinct temperature differences associated with depth. In the ocean, the thermocline divides the upper mixed layer from the calm deep water below."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cb/THERMOCLINE.png/330px-THERMOCLINE.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thermocline"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/10/Moon_jellyfishes_disturbing_the_top_water_layer_of_Gullmarn_fjord_1.jpg/500px-Moon_jellyfishes_disturbing_the_top_water_layer_of_Gullmarn_fjord_1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/10/Moon_jellyfishes_disturbing_the_top_water_layer_of_Gullmarn_fjord_1.jpg/1280px-Moon_jellyfishes_disturbing_the_top_water_layer_of_Gullmarn_fjord_1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/10/Moon_jellyfishes_disturbing_the_top_water_layer_of_Gullmarn_fjord_1.jpg/500px-Moon_jellyfishes_disturbing_the_top_water_layer_of_Gullmarn_fjord_1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Two moon jellyfish disturbing a thermocline in the top water layer of Gullmarn fjord, Sweden","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AMoon_jellyfishes_disturbing_the_top_water_layer_of_Gullmarn_fjord_1.jpg"}],"sounds":{}}}